<Slide notes={`这张关系图讲的是信息要走哪几条真实渠道。

组织者林岚需要核对场地，她要向服务台真实咨询。服务台手里有独家的预约资料，这是别处没有的。服务台回答之后，林岚在下一轮才收到这个结果，然后才谈得上比较和调整。有了依据，她才能向公告栏提交更新请求，公告栏按规则处理，最后形成一份正式的新公告。

另一条路是访客。访客要向公告栏真实查询，公告栏再向真实的请求者回复。

关键在下面这条边界：预约的答案不进入共同 Brain，只放在应当掌握它的那份材料里。如果所有人都知道答案，后面的传播就全是假的。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.1.1　一个可以贯穿全章的问题</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>答案不能提前共享</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>信息要走真实渠道，两条路不能互相代替</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>箭头表示需要真实信息渠道，不预排 Step</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>组织者渠道</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>林岚 → 服务台 → 林岚 → 公告栏 → 正式新公告</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 240, height: 76, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>林岚</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>真实咨询</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 245, height: 76, background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>服务台</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>独有预约资料</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 245, height: 76, background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>公告栏</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>有依据的更新请求</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 245, height: 76, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>正式新公告</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>提交更正后形成</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>访客渠道</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>访客 → 公告栏 → 访客；服务台回答后，组织者要到下一轮才收到</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 76, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>访客</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>真实查询</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 358, height: 76, background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>公告栏</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>向真实请求者回复</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 76, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 308, height: 76, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>访客获知</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>按实际所得更新认识</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 52, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>信息边界</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>预约答案不进入共同 Brain；本章是 4 名 Agent + 2 个对象，计划人数不是 Agent 数。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.1 把筹备方案放进一个会发生变化的世界</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>04 / 24</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
